# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 2. Start: late_e20_k1.keys's end save (Chapter 20, turn 1, Eirika has waited; game slot 2 the preparations' save). Title menu Resume Chapter, the slot list opens on slot 2 (the suspend's); the map menu on grey Eirika, End: the end-of-phase talk (skipped), the enemy phase (the enemies move, no battle this turn), turn 2's player phase from about tick 3,600 on the PC, where the game writes the turn's suspend saves.
# 5000 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Resume Chapter: the slot list (slot 2)
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, resume
000*148
001*2      # 1850: A on grey Eirika: the map menu
000*98
040*2      # 1950: Up, wraps to End
000*98
001*2      # 2050: A, End: the end-of-phase talk
000*248
008*2      # 2300: Start, skip the talk: the enemy phase
000*2698
